OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFlight chaos caused by software defect
OL,4,Ain the 'space of a millisecond', report
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe failure led to more than 2,000
OL,8,Fflights being cancelled and hundreds of
OL,9,Fthousands of passengers affected, with
OL,10,Fsome sleeping on airport floors or
OL,11,Fgetting stuck overseas.
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,14,Fcalled the disruption "completely
OL,15,Funacceptable", while industry body
OL,16,FAirlines UK is writing to Nats to
OL,17,Fdemand immediate compensation for costs
OL,18,Fincurred.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
