OL,3,AThree dead and eight injured in
OL,4,APhilippines school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old gunman has shot two
OL,7,Fstudents dead and injured eight others
OL,8,Fat a Philippine high school, before
OL,9,Fkilling himself.
OL,11,FThe two deceased victims were
OL,12,F14-year-old pupils at a school in Banga
OL,13,Fin the southern province of Mindanao,
OL,14,Fthe local mayor told the BBC.
OL,16,FAlbert Palencia said four of the
OL,17,Finjured were in critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
