OL,3,AThree dead and eight injured in
OL,4,APhilippines school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education department said in a
OL,7,Fstatement it was "deeply concerned" by
OL,8,Fthe reported incident which took place
OL,9,Fon Friday afternoon at Banga National
OL,10,FHigh School.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
