OL,3,ALindsay Clancy holdout juror says he
OL,4,Ahad no doubt she deliberately killed
OL,5,Aher children
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge declared a mistrial on 4
OL,8,FSeptember after the jury failed to
OL,9,Freach a unanimous verdict following
OL,10,Fnearly 40 hours of deliberating.
OL,12,FClancy admitted to the killings but her
OL,13,Flawyers argued she had been suffering
OL,14,Ffrom postpartum psychosis. Prosecutors
OL,15,Fsaid the killings were calculated.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
